7634	  \(\mathcal{F}\) a sheaf of \(\mathcal{O}_X\)-modules, and \(U \subseteq S'\)
7635	  an open. The sections over \(U\) of the pushforward along \(f'\) of the
7636	  pullback along \(g'\) of \(\mathcal{F}\) coincide \emph{definitionally}
7637	  with the sections of the pullback \(g'^* \mathcal{F}\) over the preimage
7638	  \(f'^{-1}(U)\):
7639	  \[
7640	    \Gamma\bigl(U,\ f'_* (g'^* \mathcal{F})\bigr)
7641	    \;=\;
7642	    \Gamma\bigl(f'^{-1}(U),\ g'^* \mathcal{F}\bigr).
7643	  \]
7644	  This records step~(3) of the affine-open construction
7645	  (\cref{thm:quot_canonical_basechange_app_app_isIso_of_isAffineOpen}): the
7646	  target of the canonical base-change map
7647	  (\cref{def:quot_canonical_basechange_map}) is read through this identity.
